Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,SSNI-916 スク水巨乳の水泳部顧問は元グラビアアイドル…濡れ透ける先生の巨乳に我慢できなくて、じっとり汗だくひたすら密着交尾 三上悠亜 （ブルーレイディスク）\Nmagnet:?xt=urn:btih:b9469e2424445059a9fb5a8912a5eeb325143a36\Ned2k://|file|www.98T.la@SSNI-916.mp4|10740665187|8CD153D29940308C9A70C56DD1CE056D|/
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.93,0:00:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,（泳衣巨乳的游泳教练）\N（忍不住老师的巨乳）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.33,0:00:10.13,Default,,0,0,0,,（浑身是汗的亲密性交）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.01,0:00:18.14,Default,,0,0,0,,（夏季）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.02,0:00:24.82,Default,,0,0,0,,（我们学校来了新老师）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.17,0:00:52.05,Default,,0,0,0,,（三上悠亚）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.59,0:01:03.52,Default,,0,0,0,,初次见面 我是今天来的老师\N三上悠亚 多多指教
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.86,0:01:07.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我是体育老师
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.93,0:01:13.39,Default,,0,0,0,,还有游泳部的顾问\N虽然还不熟
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.80,0:01:18.74,Default,,0,0,0,,但是大家一起学习吧\N今后多多指教
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.14,0:01:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,（我们的心被老师夺走了）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.09,0:01:37.01,Default,,0,0,0,,（三上悠亚新上教师）\N（体育专业）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.77,0:01:56.11,Default,,0,0,0,,（游泳部顾问）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.47,0:02:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,（之前是偶像）
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.35,0:02:41.35,Default,,0,0,0,,一个人吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.76,0:02:48.96,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 我在运动
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.17,0:02:52.57,Default,,0,0,0,,-你看那边-真的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.44,0:02:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,好厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.64,0:03:01.77,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么办呢 难得的机会
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.58,0:03:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,-做伸展运动吧-好 可以
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.92,0:03:13.25,Default,,0,0,0,,锻炼肌肉
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.92,0:03:15.91,Default,,0,0,0,,好开始吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.93,0:03:20.99,Default,,0,0,0,,大家 要开始了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.26,0:03:23.13,Default,,0,0,0,,一起来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.27,0:03:27.93,Default,,0,0,0,,首先骨关节
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.34,0:03:29.93,Default,,0,0,0,,开始放松
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.61,0:03:37.27,Default,,0,0,0,,-老师很软呢-看到了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.75,0:03:42.34,Default,,0,0,0,,一边呼吸
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.16,0:03:50.35,Default,,0,0,0,,-拉伸了吧-是
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.56,0:03:55.55,Default,,0,0,0,,下面腿张开
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.30,0:04:00.63,Default,,0,0,0,,运动之前
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.84,0:04:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你很僵硬呢
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.45,0:04:13.97,Default,,0,0,0,,-还有侧面-侧面
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.79,0:04:25.85,Default,,0,0,0,,-没事吧\N-为什么老师那么软
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.99,0:04:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,这边也要的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.67,0:04:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,大家做好了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.47,0:04:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,过来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.95,0:04:48.28,Default,,0,0,0,,开始了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.82,0:04:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.49,0:04:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,继续 呼吸
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.56,0:04:58.55,Default,,0,0,0,,呼吸
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.36,0:05:01.89,Default,,0,0,0,,还可以的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.16,0:05:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,不行了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.77,0:05:06.29,Default,,0,0,0,,1234
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.70,0:05:08.69,Default,,0,0,0,,56
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.10,0:05:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,78 好
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.97,0:05:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,,这边
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.45,0:05:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,1234567
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.85,0:05:26.72,Default,,0,0,0,,8 这边
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.79,0:05:31.25,Default,,0,0,0,,1234
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.07,0:05:40.59,Default,,0,0,0,,好今天课程结束
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.94,0:05:45.53,Default,,0,0,0,,-好 辛苦了-辛苦了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.94,0:05:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,合理分配时间很难啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.28,0:05:55.27,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.96,0:06:12.09,Default,,0,0,0,,-很冷的-舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.30,0:06:16.36,Default,,0,0,0,,-进去了吗-舒服哦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.04,0:06:20.63,Default,,0,0,0,,-真的吗-进去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.71,0:06:24.77,Default,,0,0,0,,没时间了 过来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.31,0:06:28.11,Default,,0,0,0,,-不用了-你不会吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.52,0:06:31.97,Default,,0,0,0,,-不是的-快点来
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.52,0:06:34.92,Default,,0,0,0,,很冷的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.72,0:06:37.59,Default,,0,0,0,,很热的 其实
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.93,0:06:44.92,Default,,0,0,0,,-快点来-快点过来
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.07,0:06:50.26,Default,,0,0,0,,但是
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.14,0:06:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,很冷的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.28,0:07:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了 快点过来
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.95,0:07:06.28,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.42,0:07:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起老师
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.69,0:07:12.96,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.49,0:07:17.23,Default,,0,0,0,,舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.77,0:07:21.36,Default,,0,0,0,,-老师-舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.64,0:07:24.43,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.77,0:07:27.76,Default,,0,0,0,,那么
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.91,0:07:30.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你游泳看看
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.11,0:07:33.91,Default,,0,0,0,,-不用了-你不是要运动吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.45,0:07:37.38,Default,,0,0,0,,-是的-那就做
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.99,0:07:42.58,Default,,0,0,0,,-可以吗\N-蛙泳 你不是会吗
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.93,0:07:46.86,Default,,0,0,0,,-不行-骗人
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.40,0:07:48.73,Default,,0,0,0,,试试看
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.94,0:07:57.39,Default,,0,0,0,,-没事吧\N-没事的 今天不行
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.81,0:07:59.93,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.01,0:08:03.53,Default,,0,0,0,,预备来
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.68,0:08:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,对 很好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.02,0:08:11.68,Default,,0,0,0,,-对吗-等下
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.09,0:08:14.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我扶着你吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.69,0:08:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.23,0:08:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,预备
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.09,0:08:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,手动起来
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.36,0:08:26.09,Default,,0,0,0,,-动不了了-真的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.03,0:08:29.56,Default,,0,0,0,,没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.97,0:08:35.03,Default,,0,0,0,,-可以呢-真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.58,0:08:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,-继续吧-是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.38,0:08:41.84,Default,,0,0,0,,-可以吧-预备
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.58,0:08:46.25,Default,,0,0,0,,对 很好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.65,0:08:48.25,Default,,0,0,0,,动起来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.26,0:08:52.12,Default,,0,0,0,,动起来哦
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.79,0:08:56.79,Default,,0,0,0,,没事吧 可以吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.93,0:09:00.53,Default,,0,0,0,,-可以的-对很好
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.27,0:09:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,到达了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.21,0:09:10.41,Default,,0,0,0,,-真的可以吗-可以的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.55,0:09:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,练习的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.81,0:09:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,-今天怎么了-不舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.95,0:09:20.15,Default,,0,0,0,,再来一次吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.02,0:09:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,预备
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.49,0:09:27.09,Default,,0,0,0,,下半身下去了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.50,0:09:31.49,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.70,0:09:33.76,Default,,0,0,0,,继续
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.70,0:09:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,-可以-对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.71,0:09:41.11,Default,,0,0,0,,好厉害 可以的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.38,0:09:46.97,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.45,0:09:51.51,Default,,0,0,0,,-可以吧-不行吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.65,0:09:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,,没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.39,0:09:55.79,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.72,0:09:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,-没什么-冷吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.26,0:10:02.86,Default,,0,0,0,,休息下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.47,0:10:06.06,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.87,0:10:09.39,Default,,0,0,0,,老师也是去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.68,0:10:20.48,Default,,0,0,0,,-好冷-还好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.15,0:10:24.35,Default,,0,0,0,,-没事吧-没事的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.56,0:10:29.82,Default,,0,0,0,,-怎么了-休息下
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.96,0:10:31.15,Default,,0,0,0,,累了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.89,0:10:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.83,0:10:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,没事的 很冷
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.83,0:10:41.43,Default,,0,0,0,,确实是很冷呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.84,0:10:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,老师 还好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.51,0:10:45.97,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.98,0:10:56.38,Default,,0,0,0,,-没事的吧-没事的老师
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.99,0:11:00.39,Default,,0,0,0,,-会了吗-可以的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.46,0:11:03.32,Default,,0,0,0,,会了就好
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.26,0:11:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,-怎么了害怕-没有的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.60,0:11:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我很开心的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.34,0:11:18.67,Default,,0,0,0,,老师 那个
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.61,0:11:21.87,Default,,0,0,0,,-你先走-我要打扫
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.28,0:11:25.61,Default,,0,0,0,,-我来吧-我来
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.01,0:11:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,-不好意思呢-还要上课的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.82,0:11:35.76,Default,,0,0,0,,-我要学习才行的-是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.16,0:11:42.43,Default,,0,0,0,,-没事吧-没事的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.70,0:11:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,-有事吗-没
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.84,0:11:52.03,Default,,0,0,0,,等下
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.37,0:11:56.97,Default,,0,0,0,,等下
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.98,0:12:03.78,Default,,0,0,0,,-其实-什么
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.39,0:12:08.45,Default,,0,0,0,,-我知道的-什么
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.46,0:12:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,-老师之前是偶像-是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.46,0:12:16.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我很喜欢的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.26,0:12:19.79,Default,,0,0,0,,-是吗-有照片集
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.40,0:12:24.46,Default,,0,0,0,,不是吧 那个
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.07,0:12:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗 很猥琐吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.75,0:12:35.15,Default,,0,0,0,,-看了做什么没有-什么
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.02,0:12:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,现在也是兴奋了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.42,0:12:45.55,Default,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.76,0:12:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,对不起 但是
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.23,0:12:53.56,Default,,0,0,0,,老师太美丽了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.04,0:12:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,确实是的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.04,0:13:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,那么现在试试看
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.38,0:13:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,-什么-在面前哦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.31,0:13:10.25,Default,,0,0,0,,-不行-为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.85,0:13:13.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你都看了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.92,0:13:16.65,Default,,0,0,0,,那么
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.66,0:13:19.72,Default,,0,0,0,,让我看一次
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.20,0:13:22.39,Default,,0,0,0,,好害羞啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.07,0:13:29.47,Default,,0,0,0,,-恶心-不要
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.87,0:13:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,-好害羞\N-看了写真集都这样了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.41,0:13:40.94,Default,,0,0,0,,-一直这样看吗\N-肯定会看啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.15,0:13:43.74,Default,,0,0,0,,继续吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.23,0:13:54.56,Default,,0,0,0,,-怎么办-和平时一样
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.63,0:13:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,平时一样吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.97,0:14:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我帮你吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.17,0:14:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.18,0:14:15.77,Default,,0,0,0,,这样好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.52,0:14:21.39,Default,,0,0,0,,-没说嘛-不可以的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.12,0:14:25.52,Default,,0,0,0,,游泳的时候就想了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.07,0:14:42.07,Default,,0,0,0,,-怎么样-可以的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.42,0:14:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,,好厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.62,0:15:00.36,Default,,0,0,0,,老师给你看
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.63,0:15:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.23,0:15:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,-这样的看过吧-看过的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.90,0:15:10.89,Default,,0,0,0,,你很懂啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.38,0:15:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,喜欢屁股吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.18,0:15:25.05,Default,,0,0,0,,翘臀
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.25,0:15:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,你都记得啊 看很多了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.39,0:15:35.73,Default,,0,0,0,,服务
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.93,0:15:40.40,Default,,0,0,0,,继续
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.80,0:15:44.13,Default,,0,0,0,,-好厉害-怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.27,0:15:45.74,Default,,0,0,0,,兴奋了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.88,0:15:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,多看看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.82,0:16:00.15,Default,,0,0,0,,-侧面的呢-好厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.36,0:16:06.82,Default,,0,0,0,,好厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.50,0:16:16.97,Default,,0,0,0,,好厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.98,0:16:24.97,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.12,0:16:30.71,Default,,0,0,0,,没见过 想看看
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.72,0:16:37.38,Default,,0,0,0,,想看奶子吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.79,0:16:40.85,Default,,0,0,0,,-怎么办啊-麻烦了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.66,0:16:44.32,Default,,0,0,0,,写真集只有这些吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.27,0:16:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,是的脱了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.94,0:16:51.80,Default,,0,0,0,,想看吗
